WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.054 --> 00:00:10.565
It was moving day for the hermit crabs.

2
00:00:10.566 --> 00:00:13.895
They were moving into new shells.

3
00:00:13.896 --> 00:00:18.025
"Line up, everyone!" Cora said.

4
00:00:18.026 --> 00:00:24.542
"From big to small!"

5
00:00:24.543 --> 00:00:31.190
"No pushing or shoving!" Mo said.

6
00:00:31.191 --> 00:00:37.896
Two crabs waved Cora over.

7
00:00:37.897 --> 00:00:41.257
"We have a problem," one said.

8
00:00:41.258 --> 00:00:43.222
The other one nodded.

9
00:00:43.223 --> 00:00:46.435
"We can't tell who is bigger."

10
00:00:46.436 --> 00:00:52.917
"Hmm, let me see," Cora said.

11
00:00:52.918 --> 00:01:00.980
She used her tentacles to measure.

12
00:01:00.981 --> 00:01:05.980
"You're almost the same size," Cora said.

13
00:01:05.981 --> 00:01:11.625
"But . . ." She tapped the second crab.

14
00:01:11.626 --> 00:01:15.471
"You're just a bit bigger."

15
00:01:15.472 --> 00:01:22.308
He grinned. "I knew it!"

16
00:01:22.309 --> 00:01:27.034
Soon all the crabs were in a line.

17
00:01:27.035 --> 00:01:30.747
The biggest one moved into an empty shell.

18
00:01:30.748 --> 00:01:34.765
"Just right!" she said.

19
00:01:34.766 --> 00:01:42.433
The rest started crawling into shells.

20
00:01:42.434 --> 00:01:48.221
"There!" Mo said. "Everyone has a new home."

21
00:01:48.222 --> 00:01:51.327
"Except for Herbie," Cora said.

22
00:01:51.328 --> 00:01:57.086
She pointed to the smallest crab.

23
00:01:57.087 --> 00:02:04.580
"His old shell is very tight."

24
00:02:04.581 --> 00:02:08.851
Herbie finally slid out. "I did it!"

25
00:02:08.852 --> 00:02:15.418
"There's your new shell," Mo said.

26
00:02:15.419 --> 00:02:20.295
Herbie grinned. "It looks perfect!"

27
00:02:20.296 --> 00:02:24.689
Suddenly a big wave rolled across the seafloor.

28
00:02:24.690 --> 00:02:27.320
Cora gasped.

29
00:02:27.321 --> 00:02:30.939
The wave carried Herbie's new shell away!

